'''Once you have all the components, combine 2 [[Drakkel Wolf Whisker]],  2 [[Manticore Mane]],  2 [[Siren Hair]] and 1 [[Woven Frost Giant Beard]] in a [[Sewing Kit]] to craft a [[Spool of Sacred Coldain Thread]] (trivial 162). 

